            "KEY ENCOUNTER: The earnest grunt. First seed of moral complexity.",
            "Pre-battle dialogue (page 0 start_index 5) is the visible pre-battle line.",
            "The full pre-battle speech is delivered through the event's script commands:",
            "  - 'Do you know what a fusion license costs?'",
            "  - 'People on Route 4 are losing Pok\u00e9mon because the League won't let them fuse.'",
            "  - 'We're not stealing anything. We're trying to build something that gives people access.'",
            "  - A second grunt pushes in: 'Enough talking. Handle it or I will.'",
            "  - The earnest grunt: '...Fine. I'm sorry about this.'",
            "These extended lines must be implemented in the event script commands.",
            "The text blocks here cover the RPG Maker text-box dialogue only.",
            "FULL PRE-BATTLE SCRIPT DIALOGUE (implement as sequential text commands):"
